{"id":5275,"date":"2025-08-28T09:00:41","date_gmt":"2025-08-28T09:00:41","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/?p=5275"},"modified":"2025-09-25T20:09:56","modified_gmt":"2025-09-25T13:09:56","slug":"cach-tai-tiktok-ve-may-tinh","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/kien-thuc-tiktok\/cach-tai-tiktok-ve-may-tinh\/","title":{"rendered":"C\u00e1ch t\u1ea3i Tiktok v\u1ec1 m\u00e1y t\u00ednh \u0111\u01a1n gi\u1ea3n, nhanh ch\u00f3ng"},"content":{"rendered":"<div data-page-id=\"S401dGLLgoXsvsxq05AljJKygae\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BwQBdOqXuoQGJ3xx3vRl69hlgyf\">TikTok \u0111\u00e3 tr\u1edf th\u00e0nh m\u1ed9t n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng gi\u1ea3i tr\u00ed v\u00e0 th\u01b0\u01a1ng m\u1ea1i kh\u00f4ng th\u1ec3 thi\u1ebfu tr\u00ean \u0111i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i di \u0111\u1ed9ng. Tuy nhi\u00ean, ng\u00e0y c\u00e0ng c\u00f3 nhi\u1ec1u ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng mu\u1ed1n tr\u1ea3i nghi\u1ec7m TikTok tr\u00ean m\u00e0n h\u00ecnh l\u1edbn c\u1ee7a m\u00e1y t\u00ednh \u0111\u1ec3 xem video &#8220;\u0111\u00e3 m\u1eaft&#8221; h\u01a1n, ch\u1ec9nh s\u1eeda video chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p, ho\u1eb7c th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n c\u00e1c phi\u00ean livestream \u1ed5n \u0111\u1ecbnh. B\u00e0i vi\u1ebft n\u00e0y, <strong><a href=\"http:\/\/lemondigital.vn\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">Lemon Digital <\/a><\/strong>s\u1ebd h\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn chi ti\u1ebft c\u00e1c c\u00e1ch <strong>t\u1ea3i TikTok v\u1ec1 m\u00e1y t\u00ednh<\/strong>, laptop m\u1ed9t c\u00e1ch \u0111\u01a1n gi\u1ea3n, nhanh ch\u00f3ng v\u00e0 an to\u00e0n nh\u1ea5t, gi\u00fap b\u1ea1n l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn ph\u01b0\u01a1ng ph\u00e1p ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p nh\u1ea5t v\u1edbi nhu c\u1ea7u c\u1ee7a m\u00ecnh.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-SpxLdVCCHoGxoaxMspOl7PD6gvc\">C\u00e1c c\u00e1ch t\u1ea3i TikTok v\u1ec1 m\u00e1y t\u00ednh ph\u1ed5 bi\u1ebfn<\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RYkMdl3upouEMMxMxFBlD208gVe\">Hi\u1ec7n t\u1ea1i, c\u00f3 ba ph\u01b0\u01a1ng ph\u00e1p ch\u00ednh v\u00e0 an to\u00e0n \u0111\u1ec3 b\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng TikTok tr\u00ean m\u00e1y t\u00ednh c\u1ee7a m\u00ecnh:<\/div>\n<ol class=\"list-number1\" start=\"1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VUO4dmK08oW1LbxghndlWw88g9e\" data-list=\"number\">\n<div><strong>S\u1eed d\u1ee5ng gi\u1ea3 l\u1eadp Android (Android Emulator):<\/strong> C\u00e1ch t\u1ed1i \u01b0u nh\u1ea5t \u0111\u1ec3 c\u00f3 tr\u1ea3i nghi\u1ec7m \u0111\u1ea7y \u0111\u1ee7 t\u00ednh n\u0103ng nh\u01b0 tr\u00ean \u0111i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-K3AedAyv1oAtS2xIPJsliXbDgAj\" data-list=\"number\">\n<div><strong>S\u1eed d\u1ee5ng Microsoft Store:<\/strong> C\u00e1ch \u0111\u01a1n gi\u1ea3n, ti\u1ec7n l\u1ee3i cho ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng Windows 10 v\u00e0 Windows 11.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Niaud0h6joiJnPx8cd1lomn3guc\" data-list=\"number\">\n<div><strong>S\u1eed d\u1ee5ng trang web ch\u00ednh th\u1ee9c c\u1ee7a TikTok:<\/strong> C\u00e1ch nhanh nh\u1ea5t \u0111\u1ec3 xem video m\u00e0 kh\u00f4ng c\u1ea7n c\u00e0i \u0111\u1eb7t b\u1ea5t k\u1ef3 ph\u1ea7n m\u1ec1m n\u00e0o.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-CKXed12EDoqGLYxWc4OlNYlEgLx\">H\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn chi ti\u1ebft c\u00e1ch t\u1ea3i TikTok b\u1eb1ng gi\u1ea3 l\u1eadp Android (C\u00e1ch t\u1ed1i \u01b0u nh\u1ea5t)<\/h2>\n<ol class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LeCYdkQVgoyotGx8W72lVLsngTc\" start=\"1\">\n<li data-list=\"number\">\n<h3 class=\"heading-3\"><strong>Gi\u1edbi thi\u1ec7u v\u1ec1 gi\u1ea3 l\u1eadp<\/strong><\/h3>\n<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"image-uploaded gallery old-record-id-XbcgdlnTXojc6MxPc7wlsQmFgif\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;714ef0f4-f3d1-4c29-8a27-74c39f6