,&quot;size&quot;:599879,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\n<figure id=\"attachment_5279\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-5279\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-5279\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/b938569a-db5d-4692-8db1-1f7ce713de57.png\" alt=\"\u0110\u0103ng nh\u1eadp v\u00e0 s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng TikTok t\u1eeb ph\u1ea7n m\u1ec1m gi\u1ea3 l\u1eadp Bluestacks\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/b938569a-db5d-4692-8db1-1f7ce713de57.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/b938569a-db5d-4692-8db1-1f7ce713de57-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/b938569a-db5d-4692-8db1-1f7ce713de57-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/b938569a-db5d-4692-8db1-1f7ce713de57-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/b938569a-db5d-4692-8db1-1f7ce713de57-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-5279\" class=\"wp-caption-text\"><em>\u0110\u0103ng nh\u1eadp v\u00e0 s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng TikTok t\u1eeb ph\u1ea7n m\u1ec1m gi\u1ea3 l\u1eadp Bluestacks<\/em><\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div data-page-id=\"S401dGLLgoXsvsxq05AljJKygae\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZjIGdgjD3o2DBlxpg9YlcWc7gWg\">Sau khi c\u00e0i \u0111\u1eb7t ho\u00e0n t\u1ea5t, bi\u1ec3u t\u01b0\u1ee3ng TikTok s\u1ebd xu\u1ea5t hi\u1ec7n tr\u00ean m\u00e0n h\u00ecnh ch\u00ednh c\u1ee7a BlueStacks. Gi\u1edd \u0111\u00e2y, b\u1ea1n ch\u1ec9 c\u1ea7n nh\u1ea5p v\u00e0o \u0111\u00f3, \u0111\u0103ng nh\u1eadp b\u1eb1ng t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n TikTok c\u1ee7a m\u00ecnh v\u00e0 b\u1eaft \u0111\u1ea7u tr\u1ea3i nghi\u1ec7m l\u01b0\u1edbt video, \u0111\u0103ng t\u1ea3i n\u1ed9i dung ho\u1eb7c livestream y h\u1ec7t nh\u01b0 tr\u00ean \u0111i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-RjCPdDM93oK5A4xq05vlzzezg7f\">C\u00e1ch t\u1ea3i TikTok v\u1ec1 m\u00e1y t\u00ednh t\u1eeb Microsoft Store (Windows 10\/11)<\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DWIKdC8rWoKEAOxTeRoliw61g6g\">\u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 ph\u01b0\u01a1ng ph\u00e1p ch\u00ednh th\u1ee9c v\u00e0 \u0111\u01a1n gi\u1ea3n nh\u1ea5t d\u00e0nh ri\u00eang cho ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng h\u1ec7 \u0111i\u1ec1u h\u00e0nh Windows 10 v\u00e0 11.<\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MOgId8flYovHQjxnadUlo0vYgPe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>\u01afu \u0111i\u1ec3m:<\/strong> C\u00e0i \u0111\u1eb7t nhanh ch\u00f3ng, an to\u00e0n, kh\u00f4ng c\u1ea7n ph\u1ea7n m\u1ec1m b\u00ean th\u1ee9 ba. Giao di\u1ec7n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c t\u1ed1i \u01b0u cho m\u00e1y t\u00ednh.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M12GdT8RWovO3HxyevtlWRMogog\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>H\u1ea1n ch\u1ebf:<\/strong> Ch\u1ec9 kh\u1ea3 d\u1ee5ng tr\u00ean Windows 10\/11. M\u1ed9t s\u1ed1 t\u00ednh n\u0103ng n\u00e2ng cao ho\u1eb7c hi\u1ec7u \u1ee9ng m\u1edbi c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 kh\u00f4ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c c\u1eadp nh\u1eadt nhanh b\u1eb1ng phi\u00ean b\u1ea3n di \u0111\u1ed9ng.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DmzsdOlIeoa3TNxXqYylFsXjgZd\"><strong>H\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn chi ti\u1ebft:<\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M1pudECFtohGsPxTO7slFUbyggb\"><strong>B\u01b0\u1edbc 1:<\/strong> M\u1edf \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng <strong>Microsoft Store<\/strong> tr\u00ean m\u00e1y t\u00ednh c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n (b\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 t\u00ecm n\u00f3 trong Start Menu).<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"image-uploaded gallery old-record-id-IcXVdcJPKocVzaxmi4AlG05Agib\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&qu