e0n t\u1ea5t, b\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 m\u1edf TikTok t\u1eeb Start Menu v\u00e0 \u0111\u0103ng nh\u1eadp \u0111\u1ec3 s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-OIAfdRLFMoye1pxNSeVltFgJg6W\">So s\u00e1nh c\u00e1c ph\u01b0\u01a1ng ph\u00e1p t\u1ea3i TikTok v\u1ec1 m\u00e1y t\u00ednh<\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ESnidmhh2o3MRPxLbr6lM6Urg0e\">\u0110\u1ec3 gi\u00fap b\u1ea1n d\u1ec5 d\u00e0ng l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn, d\u01b0\u1edbi \u0111\u00e2y l\u00e0 b\u1ea3ng so s\u00e1nh chi ti\u1ebft c\u00e1c ph\u01b0\u01a1ng ph\u00e1p:<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-Kst9d3eQzoDNx0xd9zpl4Gd3gSg\" data-type=\"sheet\">\n<table>\n<colgroup>\n<col width=\"105\" \/>\n<col width=\"211\" \/>\n<col width=\"240\" \/>\n<col width=\"258\" \/><\/colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Ti\u00eau ch\u00ed<\/td>\n<td>Gi\u1ea3 l\u1eadp Android (BlueStacks)<\/td>\n<td>Microsoft Store (Windows 10\/11)<\/td>\n<td data-sheet-value=\"[{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;text&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Trang web &quot;},{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;url&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;TikTok.com&quot;,&quot;link&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/TikTok.com&quot;}]\">Trang web <a href=\"http:\/\/TikTok.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">TikTok.com<\/a><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>M\u1ee9c \u0111\u1ed9 d\u1ec5 d\u00e0ng<\/td>\n<td>Trung b\u00ecnh (c\u1ea7n c\u00e0i \u0111\u1eb7t gi\u1ea3 l\u1eadp)<\/td>\n<td>R\u1ea5t d\u1ec5 (ch\u1ec9 v\u00e0i c\u00fa nh\u1ea5p chu\u1ed9t)<\/td>\n<td>C\u1ef1c d\u1ec5 (ch\u1ec9 c\u1ea7n tr\u00ecnh duy\u1ec7t)<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>T\u00ednh n\u0103ng<\/td>\n<td data-sheet-value=\"[{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;text&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:{&quot;font&quot;:&quot;bold 10pt\/1.5 MonospacedNumber, LarkHackSafariFont, LarkEmojiFont, LarkChineseQuote, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \\&quot;Helvetica Neue\\&quot;, Tahoma, \\&quot;PingFang SC\\&quot;, \\&quot;Microsoft Yahei\\&quot;, Arial, \\&quot;Hiragino Sans GB\\&quot;, sans-serif, \\&quot;Apple Color Emoji\\&quot;, \\&quot;Segoe UI Emoji\\&quot;, \\&quot;Segoe UI Symbol\\&quot;, \\&quot;Noto Color Emoji\\&quot;&quot;,&quot;foreColor&quot;:&quot;rgb(0, 0, 0)&quot;},&quot;text&quot;:&quot;\u0110\u1ea7y \u0111\u1ee7 100%&quot;},{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;text&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot; (Livestream, edit video, s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng m\u1ecdi hi\u1ec7u \u1ee9ng)&quot;}]\">\u0110\u1ea7y \u0111\u1ee7 100% (Livestream, edit video, s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng m\u1ecdi hi\u1ec7u \u1ee9ng)<\/td>\n<td>T\u01b0\u01a1ng \u0111\u1ed1i \u0111\u1ea7y \u0111\u1ee7 (c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 thi\u1ebfu m\u1ed9t s\u1ed1 t\u00ednh n\u0103ng m\u1edbi)<\/td>\n<td>H\u1ea1n ch\u1ebf (ch\u1ee7 y\u1ebfu \u0111\u1ec3 xem v\u00e0 t\u1ea3i video)<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Y\u00eau c\u1ea7u c\u1ea5u h\u00ecnh<\/td>\n<td>Trung b\u00ecnh \u0111\u1ebfn cao (c\u1ea7n m\u00e1y c\u00f3 RAM t\u1eeb 8GB tr\u1edf l\u00ean \u0111\u1ec3 m\u01b0\u1ee3t)<\/td>\n<td>Th\u1ea5p (ch\u1ea1y nh\u1eb9 nh\u00e0ng)<\/td>\n<td>R\u1ea5t th\u1ea5p (ch\u1ec9 c\u1ea7n tr\u00ecnh duy\u1ec7t)<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\u0110\u1ed1i t\u01b0\u1ee3ng ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p<\/td>\n<td>Nh\u00e0 s\u00e1ng t\u1ea1o n\u1ed9i dung, Livestreamer, ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng mu\u1ed1n tr\u1ea3i nghi\u1ec7m \u0111\u1ea7y \u0111\u1ee7 nh\u1ea5t.<\/td>\n<td>Ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng ph\u1ed5 th\u00f4ng, ch\u1ec9 c\u00f3 nhu c\u1ea7u xem video, t\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u00e1c c\u01a1 b\u1ea3n.<\/td>\n<td>Ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng mu\u1ed1n xem nhanh, kh\u00f4ng c\u00f3 nhu- c\u1ea7u c\u00e0i \u0111\u1eb7t.<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ScwPdhj83oog19xas3PlbRkqgvb\">Vi\u1ec7c s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng TikTok tr\u00ean m\u00e1y t\u00ednh mang l\u1ea1i nhi\u1ec1u l\u1ee3i \u00edch v\u01b0\u1ee3t tr\u1ed9i so v\u1edbi m\u00e0n h\u00ecnh \u0111i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i nh\u1ecf b\u00e9. T\u00f9y thu\u1ed9c v\u00e0o nhu c\u1ea7u c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n, m\u1ed7i ph\u01b0\u01a1ng ph\u00e1p \u0111\u1ec1u c\u00f3 \u01b0u v\u00e0 nh\u01b0\u1ee3c \u0111i\u1ec3m ri\u00eang. N\u1ebfu b\u1ea1n l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t nh\u00e0 s\u00e1ng t\u1ea1o n\u1ed9i dung ho\u1eb7c mu\u1ed1n tr\u1ea3i nghi\u1ec7m kh\u00f4ng gi\u1edbi h\u1ea1n, <strong>gi\u1ea3 l\u1eadp Android l\u00e0 l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn ho\u00e0n h\u1ea3o<\/strong>.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EGJBd1TqnoAoF2xm0g0lDCCPg8c\">N\u1ebfu b\u1ea1n ch\u1ec9 \u0111\u01a1n thu\u1ea7n mu\u1ed1n gi\u1ea3i tr\u00ed tr\u00ean Windows 10\/11, <strong>\u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng t\u1eeb Microsoft Store l\u00e0 qu\u00e1 \u0111\u1ee7<\/strong>. V\u00e0 cu\u1ed1i c\u00f9ng, n\u1ebfu b\u1ea1n c\u1ea7n truy c\u1eadp nhanh ch\u00f3ng m\u00e0 kh\u00f4ng mu\u1ed1n c\u00e0i \u0111\u1eb7t, <strong>trang web TikTok.com<\/strong> lu\u00f4n s\u1eb5n s\u00e0ng ph\u1ee5c v\u1ee5.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DP30dKGKtoOoq3xAATilJlF5gwf\">B\u1ea1n mu\u1ed1n c\u1eadp nh\u1eadt th\u00eam nhi\u1ec1u th\u00f4ng tin b\u1ed5 \u00edch ho\u1eb7c nh\u1eadn t\u01b0 v\u1ea5n v\u1ec1 c\u00e1c d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 li\u00ean quan \u0111\u1ebfn s\u00e0n TM\u0110T v\u1ec1 TikTok v\u00e0 c\u00e1c trang TM\u0110T Vi\u1ec7t Nam v\u00e0 qu\u1ed1c t\u1ebf n\u1ed5i ti\u1ebfng, h\u00e3y theo d\u00f5i trang blog v\u00e0 c\u00e1c trang th\u00f4ng tin c\u1ee7a <strong>Lemon Digital<\/strong>.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JpKNdtrHBosIrExNhVXlj1K8ggb\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TxmcdlUbIo4rNYxDqsklUUrXgVg\"><strong>C\u00d4NG TY C\u1ed4 PH\u1ea6N LEMON DIGITAL<\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VUKPdQ3tUottUaxPqmQlQghcgzf\"><strong>\u0110\u1ecba ch\u1ec9: <\/strong>202 Phan V\u0103n H\u00e2n, Ph\u01b0\u1eddng Gia \u0110\u1ecbnh, H\u1ed3 Ch\u00ed Minh, Vi\u1ec7t Nam<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UglUdh4lBoMLPGxlYPelEvPFgJe\"><strong>\u0110i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i: <\/strong>0938785735<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-